faqs:
  - q: What platforms do you support?
    a: Snowflake, Databricks, Redshift, Fabric, BigQuery. Plus orchestration, ingestion, and BI on top. We focus on stacks we can staff redundantly across time zones.
  - q: Can you operate a platform you did not build?
    a: Yes. We run a 2-week onboarding audit first. The audit output becomes the runbook baseline.
  - q: How do you handle on-call?
    a: Rotation staffed across time zones. Escalation ladder documented. Handoff call if you have your own on-call team.
  - q: Do you help with data platform modernization on the side?
    a: Yes. Upgrades and platform moves can run inside the managed arrangement or as a separate project engagement.
  - q: How do you protect against cost runaways?
    a: Query cost tracking, warehouse auto-suspend, budget alerts, and a monthly variance report. We flag the patterns before finance does.
